    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0007:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "When this property’s value is [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true), the session delegate receives an [`ARAppClipCodeAnchor`](arappclipcodeanchor.md) via [`session(_:didAdd:)`](arsessiondelegate/session(_:didadd:).md) for every App Clip Code that ARKit detects in the physical environment.",
      "ko": "이 property의 값이 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)면, 세션 대리자가 ARKit이 물리적 환경에서 감지한 모든 App Clip Code마다 [`session(_:didAdd:)`](arsessiondelegate/session(_:didadd:).md)로 [`ARAppClipCodeAnchor`](arappclipcodeanchor.md)를 받습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a2748769bead418f931108170dd380047ef522f59414123689331276cbcc2ebf",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "The default value is `false`.",
      "ko": "기본값은 `false`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "40511e48971c7a6c88c48f9376f0802d8d81921833ba6618e36d393966939bb7",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Before calling this function, check that the configuration supports App Clip Code tracking by calling [`supportsAppClipCodeTracking`](argeotrackingconfiguration/supportsappclipcodetracking.md).",
      "ko": "이 함수를 호출하기 전에 [`supportsAppClipCodeTracking`](argeotrackingconfiguration/supportsappclipcodetracking.md)을 호출해 구성에서 App Clip Code 추적을 지원하는지 확인해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c2cee394311a9a9c0db218984a475a469c8b67612efd882d187fa435b4d310cf",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "To avoid scanning a physical code that’s not connected to an App Clip, the system ensures that an app provides an App Clip before allowing the app to interact with App Clip Codes.",
      "ko": "App Clip과 연결되지 않은 물리적 코드를 스캔하지 않도록 시스템은 앱이 App Clip Codes와 상호 작용하기 전에 앱이 App Clip을 제공하는지 확인합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f31f1b5bc7d034c4c13dd89ffc3e48d48158dfa839035c9c51a762a52c4f704d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "Without providing an App Clip, the app can recognize codes in the environment by determining their physical location ([`transform`](aranchor/transform.md)), but code URLs ([`url`](arappclipcodeanchor/url.md)) remain `nil`.",
      "ko": "App Clip을 제공하지 않으면 앱은 물리적 위치([`transform`](aranchor/transform.md))를 통해 환경의 코드를 인식할 수 있지만 코드 URL([`url`](arappclipcodeanchor/url.md))은 `nil`로 유지됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "3fbf480d85ebf9d0320a79a9ecc6af4bdc0f9d64764ade43bc21f2e3cb169e95",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
